window.products.push({"id":459086,"name":"Rustic Kraft - Will You Be My Bridesmaid Gift for Women - Wine Bottle Label Stickers - Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713yN9bWOwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Ask your best friends to be your bridesmaid with these fun “Will You Be My Bridesmaid?” wine bottle labels. Bridesmaid wine bottle labels come in a set of 4. They are professionally printed on waterproof sticker paper. Will You Be My Bridesmaid wine labels fit standard sized wine and liquor bottles. They are easy to apply and will make a unique bridesmaid gift. (Instructions for Applying Your Beverage Stickers STEP 1: Line up your label to ensure it is straight. Use the bottle seam (if removing original label) or the edge of the original label. STEP 2: Starting at the side, lightly attach taking care to make it straight. STEP 3: Once the edge is straight, firmly attach and roll the bottle while smoothing the entire label. Tips for Using Your Beverage Stickers: For best results, remove original label but sticker labels will attach over existing labels if you choose to leave them. Attach to dry bottle for smoothest results. If beverage is to be served chilled, attach label while room temp and then refrigerate. (Wine in image is obviously NOT included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713yN9bWOwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B074JJTTGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074JJTTGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074JJTTGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
