window.products.push({"id":459117,"name":"DANSION Coffee Table, Lift Top Coffee Table with Two Foldable Storage Baskets, Two Side Lift Tabletop Central Table for Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gqZAfhb1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DOUBLE PANEL HEIGHT ADJUSTABLE】Lift top coffee table uses a more flexible double panel design. Each panel of the coffee table can be raised and lowered individually, and the table top can be raised up to 25 in to keep your waist straight. The lift top coffee table gas strut can hold up to 100 lbs in total, its durability has been rigorously tested by us, it can withstand thousands of opening and closing times. 【VARIOUS STORAGE COMPARTMENTS】Wood living room tables have variety storage spaces. Lift the panel of the coffee table to expose the large hidden compartment below, which can hold your notebook, glasses, books, and remote control. The bottom of the coffee table is an open storage compartment; we have prepared 2 foldable storage baskets for this compartment, so you don't have to worry about small items being scattered. 【Stable and Durable Lift Workbench】High quality spring hinges system enables the tabletop to be lifted up or lowered down effortlessly and noiselessly. The tabletop is stable when lifting and lowering without sudden bounces or drops. Particle board and metal frame ensures stability and durability for years of use. 【Modern Minimalist Style】A coffee table for the living room is practical and beautiful, and its elegant wooden appearance can perfectly blend with any decoration style room. With a spacious work area and storage space, fully utilize your space, this lift top table is ideal for your office, living room, or bedroom 【Easy Setup and Clean】 Follow the detailed instruction and use the tools provided, assembly complete effortlessly within 30mins. Melamine veneer, waterproof, heat-resistant and dust free, you just need a damp cloth to keep it clean. Load capacity up to 180 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gqZAfhb1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DANSION","source_asin":"B0BNMT56WT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNMT56WT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNMT56WT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
