window.products.push({"id":459220,"name":"Electric Blanket Heated Throw, Without Handheld Controller Heating Blanket, heated throw blanket with 4 Heating Levels & 4H Auto Off, Flannel & Sherpa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wzx1GfuKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WITHOUT HANDHELD CONTROLLER - OCTORO heating blankets are designed with one of a kind controls. You don't have to leave the blanket to find the controller when you wake up or are surrounded by warmth, just press the control button on the corner of the blanket to adjust the temperature. And the buttons are made of silicone, so they won't get cold in winter. [SHORTLY PRESS the on/off button 1 time to turn on the power, NO NEED to press long time] 4 TEMPERATURE & OVERHEAT PROTECTION - This electric blanket has 4 heating levels (84℉-122℉) to provide you with a variety of temperature needs. The electric blanket adopts NTC overheat protection technology to ensure that no combustion will be caused by overheating, and the insulation and flame retardancy are also stronger. (NOTE: Please do not fold or sit on the heated blanket when using it) SOFT FABRIC & MACHINE WASHABLE - Made of skin-friendly flannel and sherpa, the plush is finer and the warmth is better. The fabric is durable and does not shed. Suitable for people with sensitive skin. In addition, electric blanket is easy to clean, just disconnect the controller and then wash it by hand or machine (Note: Do not tumble dry). THE BEST Gift & PERFECT SIZE - The 50\"x60\" single electric blanket is the perfect gift for birthdays or holidays such as Christmas, Halloween and cold weather. Electric blankets can also relieve muscle aches and joint pains and are easy to use, making them a great gift for seniors, women's mesnstrual cramps and those recovering from surgery. LIFETIME WARRANTY & 100% SERVICE - OCTORO electric blanket is certified by UL and FCC testing. To allow it serve you for years, the shoulder heating pads has been beaten and folded for more than 10,000 times of simulated use to ensure the safety and reliability of the product. If any questions, please feel free to contact us for 24H after-sales service, we promise a quick response and a nice solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wzx1GfuKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCTORO","source_asin":"B0BK96M6HL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK96M6HL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK96M6HL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
