window.products.push({"id":459330,"name":"Candle Holder Candlestick Holders Glass Taper Candle Holders for Table Centerpiece Perfect for Home Decor, Weddings, Restaurants, and Dinner Parties, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ga8S3iwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ CANDLE HOLDERS GLASS ❤ The glass taper candle holders are perfect for your home décor. The clarity allows for your candle glow to twinkle and glistens off the thick glass which adds ambiance to any setting. Add a taper or a candlestick to create dramatic centerpieces, and make the decoration more romantic, warm, and special! ❤ IMPORTANT TIPS ❤ 1. Please do not use candle holders with cracks. Because candle holders are glass products, if you receive a cracked candle holder, even if it is a slight crack, please contact us for a new set. 2, Never leave a burning candle unattended. When the candle burns to a length of fewer than 3 inches, please remove it from the holder promptly. ❤ TAPER CANDLE HOLDERS ❤ The candle holders measure just over 2.2inches tall and are 2.03inches wide at the base. The top opening measures 0.9inch and tapers inward. Suitable for regular taper candles, tall candles, flameless LED candles, which have a diameter of less than 0.9inch. ❤ ELEGANT & STURDY CANDLESTICKS ❤ The Curved design makes taper candle holders become very stylish. The candlestick holders with thick lead-free vitreous walls and wide round bases provide firm support for candlestick holders, stable and safe for your use. They will serve for your romantic and significant moments with exquisite decorations. ❤ PERFECT GIFT FOR KINDS OF SITUATIONS ❤ You can also use it to create a beautiful ambiance at weddings as well as at dinner parties. They are perfect gifts for housewarming, weddings, dinner parties, and solutions for DIY projects. Set a pretty table at dinner, in a restaurant, at a wedding or event, plus pretty candlelight with taper candles in this glass candlestick.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ga8S3iwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENCANLIGHT","source_asin":"B0BQ9HSQ8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ9HSQ8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ9HSQ8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
