window.products.push({"id":459454,"name":"All-Clad d5 Stainless Steel 3-Quart Sauteuse with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31hPUPlBDXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Representing the best in American craftsmanship, All-Clad’s d5 Stainless Steel line incorporates five-layer bonded construction as well as functional advances that make it the finest stainless-steel cookware to date. This pan lets you sear, sauté, pan-roast, braise and prepare flavorful pan sauces and gravies. Each of the five bonded layers serves a specific purpose, creating a noticeable difference in cooking performance. 18/10 stainless-steel interior for foolproof browning and easy cleanup. - Two aluminum layers, one to conduct and one to sustain heat. - Patented stainless-steel core diffuses heat for consistent results. - Magnetic stainless-steel exterior for durability and dishwasher-safe ease. Straight sides accommodate liquids; a lid locks in moisture for slow braising. - Improved stay-cool stick handle with finger guard for balance and control. - Rims are shaped to allow for dripless pouring. - Extra-large loop handle on lid is easy to grip, even with oven mitts. - Pan size etched on base for quick identification.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31hPUPlBDXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B004A9CJQA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004A9CJQA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004A9CJQA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":459455,"name":"CounterArt Bamboo Turkey Carving Board, 20-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-0bb+jI7L._AC_.jpg","description":"This thick, sturdy carving board from CounterArt is perfect for carving turkey or any roast. This board features Grade A natural bamboo for beauty and durability, with a deep juice groove on one side, and an indentation in the center to hold the meat steady while carving. On the reverse side, there are indented finger notches for comfortable lifting and transporting. The heating process we use in production turns the bamboo a gorgeous brown color. Oil with food grade oil before use and periodically thereafter, and enjoy this amazing board for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-0bb+jI7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Counterart","source_asin":"B00337WIWU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00337WIWU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00337WIWU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":459456,"name":"Smartele Battery Operated Fan, Battery Powered Fan, Rechargeable Floor Fan, Battery Fan for Camping, Portable & Rechargeable, 15000mAh Battery, Fast C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bFMDap2iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FASTER RECHARGEABLE & LONGER USE】 Smartele 16 inch rechargeable fan has a built-in large-capacity lithium-ion battery of 15000mAh, a 24V AC adapter, the latest fast charging technology, making it only takes 2 hours to fully charge. This outdoor fan can operate continuously up to 30 hours at the minimum fan speed setting. It can keep you cool all day long. The built-in battery of this portable fan can also charge digital devices such as smartphones through a USB port. 【HIGH-VELOCITY AIR CIRCULATING FEATURE】 This battery-powered fan is equipped with a powerful brushless DC motor and 5pcs durable fan blades. The rechargeable fan can deliver a maximum airflow of 2500 CFM and this high-velocity fan can move a large volume of air to efficiently improve air circulation around you. The 160° adjustable tilt of this portable fan helps to precisely direct the air where cooling is most needed. You can keep it cool anywhere you want. 【MORE USER-FRIENDLY DESIGN】 To avoid sudden running out of battery, this rechargeable fan has 5 LED indicators on top of the control box to indicate the remaining power and to remind you to charge the fan in time. This rechargeable floor fan has a step-less speed adjustment knob, Smartele cordless fan allows you to control the wind speed and noise level according to your need. By the way, this portable outdoor fan possesses a 7mm diameter net cover, safer for children! 【DESIGNED FOR EXTREME OUTDOOR USE】This outdoor fan has a sturdy metal structure, a large carrying handle, and non-slip rubber feet. This rugged and durable outdoor fan is designed to operate in a variety of environments. This rechargeable outdoor fan is IPX4 certified so it is water-resistant and splash-proof. It can withstand occasional sudden showers during outdoor work or camping. This portable battery fan provides you with a reliable and convenient outdoor cooling solution. 【WARRANTY & WORRY-FREE AFTER SALES】Smartele focus on providing excellent service. We value both product quality and customer satisfaction. We strive to address your questions within 24 hours. You are entitled to a replacement or refund for a major failure and compensation for any other reasonably foreseeable loss or damage. Smartele offers a professional technical support team, located in LA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bFMDap2iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smartele","source_asin":"B0B3D9ZCV9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3D9ZCV9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3D9ZCV9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
