window.products.push({"id":459567,"name":"Kotobuki Zodiac Series Crayon Mug, Year of The Dog, Sky Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tDbRhgZbL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Kotobuki Crayon Series of colored mugs features whimsical characters that will bring a smile to everybody who uses one. The versatile size can be used by all ages as a feeding mug, soup mug, large coffee mug, and more. This sky blue dog design was inspired by the Chinese zodiac calendar. The calendar is based on a 12-year cycle, in which every calendar year within the cycle is represented by a different animal. The animal for any given year is said to have certain qualities and traits that, for a human born in that year, is said to possess as well. Year of The Dog birth years: 1922, 1934, 1946, 1958, 1970, 1982, 1994, 2006. People born in the Year of The Dog are kind and loyal. They are also trustworthy and dependable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tDbRhgZbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kotobuki","source_asin":"B0079M89LY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0079M89LY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0079M89LY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
