window.products.push({"id":459623,"name":"Personalized Feliz Navidad Decorations 2022, Mexican Ornaments for Christmas Tree, Red Heart Feliz Navidad Ornament, Mexico Christmas Ornament, Spanis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jWQk+X9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Christmas Tree Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our Holiday ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a heart ornament with white ribbon and text that reads “Feliz Navidad!” This Holiday, add a little charm to your Christmas decorations with this whimsical Christmas tree ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized Mexican ornaments for Christmas tree often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every Spanish ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure a unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND Feliz Navidad Christmas ornament you'll always cherish. Add it to your Christmas ornaments set! Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – and the activities that bring you joy and fulfillment. Every year, you decorate your tree with personalized Holiday decorations that represent special moments in your life. With our merry Christmas decoration 2022, expand your collection with the personalized ornaments that represent your family’s greatest pleasures. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors, this Hispanic Feliz Navidad ornament 2022 will make your tree feel truly special and unique! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our Christmas tree ornaments make beautiful addition to your fun ornaments for Christmas tree, Feliz Navidad Christmas decorations and heart ornaments for tree to cherish every season. Your Christmas tree ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! This tree ornament will bring some Holiday cheer to your home! The cutest ornament and ultimate present for families and friends! Happy Families – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful, unique decorative Christmas hanging ornaments for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your Mexican Christmas decorations 2022, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jWQk+X9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B08HSXWGHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HSXWGHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HSXWGHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
