window.products.push({"id":459808,"name":"4x6 Picture Frames Distressed Brown - Weathered Look (3 Pack) Farmhouse Wood Grain Designed with High Definition Glass For Table Top Display And Wall ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+QKyoO2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRESERVE THE MEMORIES TO LAST A LIFETIME  Memories take a special place in your heart. Whether they're the shiny recollections of your wedding day, to the pride your child's graduation frame evokes in your soul, or your baby's first steps - those milestones are monumental. But so too are the little moments. The panorama of the sun setting on your hike, a stolen kiss with your partner, your dog. These memories are just as important.  We're in the business of preserving those memories. This set of frames is durable, well-made, and classy. They're sold in sets of 3 so you could create a fun montage of picture collage frames on a foyer console, or spread the farmhouse picture frames all over the house. The choice - and, therefore, the versatility - is yours to command, in just the way that you choose.  Features to fall in love with:  -Made of polystyrene with a wood grain finish -Sophisticated subdued black fits most decor -Available Colors in Distressed Black, Beige and Brown -Available in: 4x6\", 5x7\" and 8x10\" (sets of 3)  Sometimes, you need that little vintage touch to add charm to your home. Each picture frame is elegant and understated. That means each photograph or artwork - each memory - is the hero, not the picture frame. Give Dad a frame with a sweet photo of the prize trout he caught that one year. Give Mom a birthday present of hanging picture frames containing your graduation photos. Give your siblings photos of their pets. It's all a beautiful thing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+QKyoO2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NexHome","source_asin":"B087LYCVC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087LYCVC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087LYCVC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
