window.products.push({"id":459844,"name":"Swift Home Moselle 100% Cotton Ruched & Waffle Weave Bedding Duvet Cover Set, All Season & Breathable, Oeko-TEX Certified – Dark Grey, King/Cal King (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lL4zvs8+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT'S INSIDE - King/Cal King Set includes 3 pieces: One duvet cover 104x92\", two king shams 20x36\" IRRESISTIBLE DESIGN - On trend and highly sought-after, this Moselle Cotton Ruched & Waffle Weave Duvet Cover Set utilized state of-the-art weaving technology to create the lovely textile details that add an impeccable texture and style to your bed. Crafted from 100% premium cotton fabric for ultimate breathability and moisture absorption, this duvet cover will provide unparalleled comfortable, refreshing, and rejuvenating sleep. SUPERB CRAFTMANSHIP - Thoughtful details were added to enhance your experience. Easy-to-spot button closure at the bottom of the duvet cover makes for a quick installation and removal of the duvet insert. Long corner ties are also sewn inside to prevent the insert from shifting and to keep you from tossing and turning in your sleep. EASY CARE - Machine washable, we recommending washing this set in cold water with like colors and tumble dry on low heat, and do not bleach for best maintenance practices. OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED - This product is Oeko-Tex Certified, meaning it has been tested and certified to be free from harmful chemicals which ensures the textiles meet high safety standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lL4zvs8+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swift Home","source_asin":"B08NGW9B4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NGW9B4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NGW9B4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":459845,"name":"Personalized Custom Police Car Fleece and Sherpa Throw Blanket for Boys, Girls, Kids, Baby - Toddler Police Car Blankets Perfect for Bedtime, Bedding ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713X434vNHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights.  Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party.  This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses).  The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun.  The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.  After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free.  Soft and warm, but durable, exactly how a top quality blanket should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713X434vNHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07KCMLBRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCMLBRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCMLBRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":459846,"name":"Just Runners Steve Prefontaine Poster Made of Cloth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NPQ721iFL._AC_.jpg","description":"A huge cloth poster of Steve Prefontaine. The photo was taken by Jeff Johnson at Hayward Field. The black and white cloth poster is 4 feet x 2.5 feet and has a quote from \"Pre\" on it. The quote says \"A lot of people run a race to see who is the fastest. I run to see who has the most guts.\" The tapestry is printed on a sheer, soft-as-silk like material for the highest quality. It will not tear and can even be washed and ironed. You can use tacks, velcro, tape or slip into ceiling panels without damaging the poster. The poster is compact and can be taken to a meet and can be used as bandanna, flag or any other creative idea. It's a great gift idea or a cool collectible for any Pre fan!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NPQ721iFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JustRunners","source_asin":"B0007807MQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-459846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007807MQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007807MQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
